                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "04f83800-6774-3278-a477-cf4c998a6d33",
                        "entry_id": "6fe7700c-9425-3b7f-be34-56dd8095cc44",
                        "glosses": [
                            "большая (длиной не менее 24 метров) прогулочная яхта"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1849c946-1853-4d40-8c8e-fe473cf208f5",
                                "sense_id": "04f83800-6774-3278-a477-cf4c998a6d33",
                                "text": ".. в дополнение к трем имеющимся у олигарха суперъяхтам сейчас на голландских верфях вовсю строится четвертая."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "03be6f05-0607-4aed-959d-a1c01b82e455",
                                "sense_id": "04f83800-6774-3278-a477-cf4c998a6d33",
                                "text": "После удвоения объемов строительства и продаж суперъяхт в 2009–2014 годах, совпавшим с удвоением числа долларовых миллиардеров в мире, в 2015-м признаки бума в индустрии самых дорогих индивидуальных средств передвижения по воде стали сходить на нет."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e49b0afa-d1f8-4bdf-b718-86f172c5eed8",
                        "source_entry_id": "6fe7700c-9425-3b7f-be34-56dd8095cc44",
                        "source_sense_id": "04f83800-6774-3278-a477-cf4c998a6d33",
                        "target_lang_word": "superyacht",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "superyacht",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd056e0b-36bb-3252-9e59-e254957f59a7",
                                        "entry_id": "9416026a-065b-3481-b90d-5123a66e671f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A very large luxury yacht."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59556eb1-7b3c-4b87-bebb-7ba942bea9a1",
                                                "sense_id": "bd056e0b-36bb-3252-9e59-e254957f59a7",
                                                "text": "Tom Perkins[…] is putting his superyacht, the Maltese Falcon, up for sale, just two years after he first set sail on it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01885fd3-0732-4ec6-a069-bead0a5efe4b",
                                                "sense_id": "bd056e0b-36bb-3252-9e59-e254957f59a7",
                                                "text": "This latest concept comes as demand for superyachts continues to grow – the global fleet jumped from 3,906 crafts in 2009 to 5,646 in 2019, according to the Superyacht Group. […] Recent examples include Ultra2, a new 95-meter superyacht from Berlin-based T.Fotiadis Design that has its own on-board safe room."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a066d36a-7c67-4cef-9bae-eaab1ab9f8df",
                                                "sense_id": "bd056e0b-36bb-3252-9e59-e254957f59a7",
                                                "text": "If it has crew working aboard, it's a yacht. If it's more than ninety-eight feet [30 m], it's a superyacht."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aec437a3-caa8-43b8-8f87-23e85b192b5c",
                        "source_entry_id": "6fe7700c-9425-3b7f-be34-56dd8095cc44",
                        "source_sense_id": "04f83800-6774-3278-a477-cf4c998a6d33",
                        "target_lang_word": "megayacht",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "megayacht",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "de68071f-d210-3be2-804d-26ef95c48744",
                                        "entry_id": "692a947b-75bd-3cdc-941e-4372c9ba9fe2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A very large luxury yacht."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "21a63d11-cb69-4cc4-b7de-57feea1391dd",
                                                "sense_id": "de68071f-d210-3be2-804d-26ef95c48744",
                                                "text": "A fitness center, a lounge and a swimming pool with cabanas will be built, but owners and their guests will also be granted access to all the resort’s amenities, which include […] a marina capable of accommodating megayachts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7213807-b862-4e30-bff8-f54a47cae821",
                                                "sense_id": "de68071f-d210-3be2-804d-26ef95c48744",
                                                "text": "“Demand for the megayachts above 130 to 140 meters has definitely increased in the last few years,” said Mark Duncan, group commercial director of yacht brokerage house, Yachting Partners International."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8de7922c-cdbd-42b0-8252-27c95f72a0e1",
                                                "sense_id": "de68071f-d210-3be2-804d-26ef95c48744",
                                                "text": "The megayacht concept is equipped with its own port with enough space for a second yacht measuring up to 30 meters, as well as three swimming pools."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c620f16-4d46-4777-a680-d1e80cdd7b5c",
                                                "sense_id": "de68071f-d210-3be2-804d-26ef95c48744",
                                                "text": "After that, definitions are debated, but people generally agree that anything more than 230 feet is a megayacht, and more than 295 is a gigayacht."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9c170b8d-8308-4d11-87c8-c73fc13036b7",
